.TH OWASP-A01 7 "2026-11-15" "OWASP Top 10:2025" "Software Weakness Reference"
.SH NAME
owasp\-a01 \- Broken Access Control (OWASP Top 10:2025 A01)
.SH RANK
OWASP Top 10:2025 rank \fB#1\fR (A01:2021; A10:2021 SSRF folded in).
.SH DESCRIPTION
The application does not enforce what an authenticated user is allowed to do. Attackers access other users' data, change object IDs in the URL, or reach admin functions. Server\-Side Request Forgery is in this category in 2025.
.PP
This page is an overlay. Vulnerable\->fixed code lives on the \fBcwe\-*\fR(7) pages listed below, not here.
